# Paths this repository declares out of scope for contract-gate.
#
# One glob per line, matched against the repository-relative path.

# The PaperMod theme is a git submodule pinned to one upstream commit. Nothing in
# it is written here, and the gitlink is a directory the secrets lane cannot
# read, so it fails closed on every commit that moves the pin. credential-guard
# found nothing across its 125 files at the pinned commit; scan it the same way
# before trusting this line to cover a new pin.
themes/PaperMod
themes/PaperMod/**
